eak"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mobPDgTPQ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真がテレビに映ることになるなんて😮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかの衝撃写真でしたね…🩹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引っ掻かれたのが、ちょうど研修生ツアーの集中レッスンの最中でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めは見た目がかなり悲惨だったので、長袖で必死に隠してたなぁ、、暑かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プランク??体幹トレーニングが辛かった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は親指の付け根が膿んでいて、グーパーすらまともにできない状態でしたが、ちゃんと病院で消毒してもらい、順調に治っていきました😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ヶ月でここまで治り、↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mobtdd3PN.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年後には…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mobNcXMaL.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんど見えなくなりました〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも本当に気をつけてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫の喧嘩には、入らない!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、頭近づけなくて本当によかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔の引っ掻き跡が増えるところでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mobF0sMKI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(おでこ)\n既にあるんか〜い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ猫の仕業です🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凶暴な猫で、野良猫さんにも申し訳ない🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mob5xY0yG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく蹴り飛ばされますが、仲良しです🤍🐱👩🏻🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/12発売、「欅共和国2019」　　　特典映像 『The Documentary of 欅共和国2019』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告編が公開されています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/YxuFoMOG-M4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキュメンタリー映像、凄く心に響くので大好きです。\n発売日、楽しみ、待ちきれない😣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レターで頂いた質問に答えます✉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.綺良ちゃんのすきなフルーツはなんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はきらちゃんのほっぺが美味しそうだなって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.メロン!でもメロン飴は好きじゃないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.きらるな(乃木坂さん)の白目コラボ見たいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.白目はできませんが、この間ビデオ通話でひたすら2人の顔を組み合わせてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどおかしな顔になってたんですけど、これはいい感じにできた!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/mob1kjUEE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.改札でsuicaなどをタッチする時に気をつけていることは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.残高"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.プロレスって見た事ありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なれけばどんな印象を持ってますか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.見たことないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝った時の笑顔は思い浮かびます💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"達成感のある競技なんだろうなぁという印象です🙆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.「月曜からまた仕事か…」となり、日曜日を全力で楽しめません。アドバイスお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.平日と休日で環境に違いを付けるのはどうですか!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば、平日のお仕事の日はカーテンを閉めて過ごして、休日はカーテンを開けて過ごすとか!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち切り替わりそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❓Q.マスモッティーって呼んでいい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.いいですよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最近新たなあだ名ができたんですよ、『きらこ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜\n最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/202008/moblgfaqD.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱中症には気をつけて下さい☀️　　　　増本綺良(きらこ)"}],"source":"official"}}